/E (We successfully developed and evaluated a Burmese ASR system using Kaldi. We compared traditional GMM-HMM models with neural acoustic modeling. The best traditional system, Tri3 + Trigram, achieved 96.06% WER, while the Convolution + LSTM DNN achieved approximately 72% WER, giving the best overall performance in our experiments.)
